<title>UK: National Grid to respond to OFFER by Oct 30.</title>
<headline>National Grid to respond to OFFER by Oct 30.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Grid Group Plc said on Thursday it was reviewing industry watchdog OFFER's final proposals on transmission price controls and would give its response by October 30.</p>
<p>OFFER said earlier its final proposals were for a one-off 20 percent cut in the first year of controls from April 1997 followed by cuts of RPI minus four until March 2001.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
